---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CONTACT_EMAIL, LAST_UPDATED, LEGAL, SITE_NAMES, SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title={`${SITE_NAMES[lang]} legal notice: publisher, host, terms and data`} description="Publisher and host of VisaCalc, terms of use of its UK visa calculators, why they are not legal advice, the GOV.UK data reused under the Open Government Licence, and the law." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Legal notice' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-headings:font-serif">
    <h1>Legal notice and terms of use</h1>
    <p>Information given under Article 6 III-1 of French law no. 2004-575 of 21 June 2004, the publisher being established in France.</p>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <p>Publication director: {AUTHOR_NAME}, responsible for the content of {SITE_URL}.</p>
    <h2>Host</h2>
    <LegalIdentity mode="hosting" lang={lang} />
    <h2>Not legal advice, not the Home Office</h2>
    <p>{SITE_NAMES[lang]} applies the published fee table and Immigration Rules to the figures you enter. It is not legal advice, is not affiliated with the Home Office, UK Visas and Immigration or any government body, and its results do not bind anyone: the Home Office decides each application on the evidence and the rules in force on the day. Rules and fees change with each Statement of Changes; check GOV.UK before you apply and consult a solicitor or an adviser registered with the Immigration Advice Authority for advice on your case.</p>
    <h2>The data and its source</h2>
    <p>Fees, rules, going rates, processing times and the register of licensed sponsors are published by the Home Office on GOV.UK and reused under the Open Government Licence v3.0 (contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0). Neither the Home Office nor any public body endorses this site. The calculations built on them (thresholds, totals, dates) are this site's own and are presented as such.</p>
    <h2>Liability</h2><p>The official figures are read on GOV.UK and the calculations are tested before each release, yet errors cannot be ruled out. The publisher is not liable for decisions taken on the basis of this site. Please report any error through the <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Intellectual property</h2><p>Texts, design and code belong to the publisher; short quotations with a link are welcome. Crown copyright material remains under the Open Government Licence.</p>
    <h2>Embedding</h2><p>The cost calculator may be embedded for free with its credit link visible: see the <a href={route('widget', lang)}>embed page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Personal data</h2><p>The site sets no cookie and keeps nothing you choose or type. Details: <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Reporting unlawful content</h2><p>Write to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> with the address of the page.</p>
    <h2>Governing law</h2><p>French law applies; failing an amicable settlement, the courts of {LEGAL.jurisdiction} have jurisdiction. Updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
